<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Hicor Trading set to buy Allwear.</title>
<headline>Hicor Trading set to buy Allwear.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hicor Ltd said on Monday that talks were at an advanced stage for its Hicor Trading Ltd unit to buy the business of partly-owned subsidiary Allwear Ltd for 31 million rand or 220 cents a share.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
